{"title": "Mobile: Evade Opportunity Attack", "pageid": 21448, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Mobile:_Evade_Opportunity_Attack", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mobile_Evade_Opportunity_Attack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Mobile_Evade_Opportunity_Attack.webp/300px-Mobile_Evade_Opportunity_Attack.webp, /w/images/d/df/Mobile_Evade_Opportunity_Attack.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Mobile_Evade_Opportunity_Attack.webp/300px-Mobile_Evade_Opportunity_Attack.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/df/Mobile_Evade_Opportunity_Attack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Mobile: Evade Opportunity Attack</b> is a passive feature that lets a creature move away from a target without provoking <a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\">Opportunity Attacks</a>, after they have made a melee attack.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>If you move after making a melee attack, you don't provoke Opportunity Attacks from your target. \n</p><p>The effect still works if your attack misses.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Sluggardly\"> Condition: Sluggardly </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sluggardly_(Condition)\" title=\"Sluggardly (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Sluggardly_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Sluggardly_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Sluggardly_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Sluggardly_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Sluggardly_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Sluggardly_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sluggardly\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Sluggardly_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Sluggardly_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/Sluggardly_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sluggardly_(Condition)\" title=\"Sluggardly (Condition)\">Sluggardly</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Can't make an <a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\">Opportunity Attack</a> against its most recent attacker.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Mobile\" title=\"Mobile\">Mobile</a>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Dadger\" title=\"Dadger\">Dadger</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Erus\" title=\"Erus\">Erus</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Faona\" title=\"Faona\">Faona</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Galleass\" title=\"Galleass\">Galleass</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gurira\" title=\"Gurira\">Gurira</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Heen\" title=\"Heen\">Heen</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Helenia\" title=\"Helenia\">Helenia</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Jacko\" title=\"Jacko\">Jacko</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Loretta\" title=\"Loretta\">Loretta</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Morra\" title=\"Morra\">Morra</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Smathers\" title=\"Smathers\">Smathers</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Thamberg\" title=\"Thamberg\">Thamberg</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/The_Warden\" title=\"The Warden\">The Warden</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Theoda\" title=\"Theoda\">Theoda</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Triava\" title=\"Triava\">Triava</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Yonni\" title=\"Yonni\">Yonni</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Your melee attacks (including melee <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a> spells) will inflict <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sluggardly_(Condition)\" title=\"Sluggardly (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Sluggardly_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Sluggardly_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Sluggardly_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Sluggardly_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Sluggardly_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Sluggardly_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sluggardly\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Sluggardly_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Sluggardly_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/Sluggardly_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sluggardly_(Condition)\" title=\"Sluggardly (Condition)\">Sluggardly</a> on your targets for <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714204447\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1323/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 10957/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4344/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 898/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.0